{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/extras/dff346315d1ea709b0bfe5d6e12cef3e.poster.avif?t=1770606515\" width=552 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/extras/dff346315d1ea709b0bfe5d6e12cef3e.webm?t=1770606515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/extras/dff346315d1ea709b0bfe5d6e12cef3e.mp4?t=1770606515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIMULSAGA: DATA_BREAK is a darkly humorous horror RPG. You play as an office drone who lives a seemingly ordinary life, but something isn't right... A mysterious stranger will soon set into motion a series of events that gradually reveal the horrifying truth...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspirations include Earthbound, Undertale, One Shot and LISA: The Painful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mundane existence in game, as well as in real life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get showered, go to work, eat, sleep!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PLAYABLE TOILET!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat or befriend foes like spiders, the elderly, teens, someone that definitely isn't Mickey Mouse, your boss, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of choices, and some that will bite you in the *** later!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your cat. Or not because you are heartless POS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An awesome original and authentic 8-bit soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of jokes, references and Easter eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but sweet, with several endings - Expect the length of a long movie for an average playthough. For 100% completion up to 10 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the meaning of life*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*you might not learn the meaning of life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1838120?t=1770606515","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1838120?t=1770606515","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/78513cfc684fd7ab18371623c55601911e3937fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770606515","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/78513cfc684fd7ab18371623c55601911e3937fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770606515","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2168500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/extras/dff346315d1ea709b0bfe5d6e12cef3e.poster.avif?t=1770606515\" width=552 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/extras/dff346315d1ea709b0bfe5d6e12cef3e.webm?t=1770606515\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/extras/dff346315d1ea709b0bfe5d6e12cef3e.mp4?t=1770606515\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIMULSAGA: DATA_BREAK is a darkly humorous horror RPG. You play as an office drone who lives a seemingly ordinary life, but something isn't right... A mysterious stranger will soon set into motion a series of events that gradually reveal the horrifying truth...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspirations include Earthbound, Undertale, One Shot and LISA: The Painful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mundane existence in game, as well as in real life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get showered, go to work, eat, sleep!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PLAYABLE TOILET!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat or befriend foes like spiders, the elderly, teens, someone that definitely isn't Mickey Mouse, your boss, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of choices, and some that will bite you in the *** later!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your cat. Or not because you are heartless POS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An awesome original and authentic 8-bit soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of jokes, references and Easter eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but sweet, with several endings - Expect the length of a long movie for an average playthough. For 100% completion up to 10 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the meaning of life*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*you might not learn the meaning of life.</p>","developers":["Giggles Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838120/74ec4fb065b8d973d23be063c45323b3c2995f21/header.jpg?t=1770606515","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers